quad \\sum _{i,j=1}^n a^{ij}(x)\\xi _i\\xi _j \\geq \\theta |\\xi |^2 \\]\">\\[ (4) \\qquad \\sum _{i,j=1}^n a^{ij}(x)\\xi _i\\xi _j \\geq \\theta |\\xi |^2 \\]</span> for a.e. <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$x \\in U$\">$x \\in U$</span> and all <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\xi \\in \\R ^n$\">$\\xi \\in \\R ^n$</span>. ","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: group"]},"previous":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter6#rem:elliptic-operator-form-conversion","next":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter6#rem:elliptic-pde-physical-interpretation","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter6#def:divergence-nondivergence-form","title":"def:divergence-nondivergence-form","label":"def:divergence-nondivergence-form"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter6#rem:elliptic-pde-physical-interpretation","title":"rem:elliptic-pde-physical-interpretation","label":"rem:elliptic-pde-physical-interpretation"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter6#thm:energy-estimates","title":"thm:energy-estimates","label":"thm:energy-estimates"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter6#thm:interior-h2-regularity","title":"thm:interior-h2-regularity","label":"thm:interior-h2-regularity"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter6#thm:boundary-h2-regularity","title":"thm:boundary-h2-regularity","label":"thm:boundary-h2-regularity"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter6#thm:weak-maximum-principle-c-zero","title":"thm:weak-maximum-principle-c-zero","label":"thm:weak-maximum-principle-c-zero"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter6#lem:hopfs-lemma","title":"lem:hopfs-lemma","label":"lem:hopfs-lemma"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter7#rem:parabolic-operator-elliptic-fix